#: about/aboutpage.cpp:69
msgid "Welcome to Plan."
msgstr "Willkamen bi Plan."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:70
msgid ""
"These introductory pages should give you an idea of how to use Plan and what "
"you can use it for."
msgstr ""
"Disse Inföhren schall Di den Bruuk vun Plaan verkloren, un wat sik mit dat "
"Programm so all maken lett."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:71
msgid "A short introduction."
msgstr "En Kortinföhren"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:72
msgid "Tips on how to manipulate and inspect data."
msgstr "Tipps för't Bewerken un Pröven vun Daten"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:73
msgid "A small tutorial to get you started."
msgstr "En kort Inföhren, de Di bi den Start hölpen schall."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:75
msgid ""
"<em>Note:</em> To view these pages when you are in other parts of Plan, "
"choose the menu option <em>Help ->  Introduction to Plan</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Henwies:</em> Wullt Du disse Sieden ut en anner Plan-Menü opropen, bruuk "
"de Menü-Optschoon <em>Hülp -> Plan-Inföhren</em>."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:101
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Plan is intended for managing moderately large projects with multiple "
#| "resources. To enable you to model your project adequately, Plan offers "
#| "different types of task dependencies and timing constraints. Usually you "
#| "will define your tasks, estimate the effort needed to perform each task, "
#| "allocate resources and then schedule the project according to the "
#| "dependency network and resource availability.<p>You can find more "
#| "information in the <a href=\"help:kplato\">documentation</a> or online at "
#| "<a href=\"http://www.koffice.org/kplato\">http://www.koffice.org/kplato</"
#| "a></p>"
msgid ""
"Plan is intended for managing moderately large projects with multiple "
"resources. To enable you to model your project adequately, Plan offers "
"different types of task dependencies and timing constraints. Usually you "
"will define your tasks, estimate the effort needed to perform each task, "
"allocate resources and then schedule the project according to the dependency "
"network and resource availability.<p>You can find more information in the <a "
"href=\"help:plan\">documentation</a> or online at <a href=\"http://www."
"calligra.org/plan\">http://www.calligra.org/plan</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"Plan is för't Plegen vun middelgroot Projekten mit wat mehr Ressourcen "
"maakt. Dormit Du Dien Projekt propper afbillen kannst, stellt Plan en Reeg "
"Typen vun Opgaav-Afhangigkeiten un Tiet-Ingrenzen praat. Normalerwies leggst "
"Du de Opgaven fast, estemeerst dor den Opwand för, wiest de Ressourcen to un "
"plaanst dat Projekt denn na de Afhangigkeiten langs de Verföögborkeit vun de "
"Ressourcen.<p>Mehr Informatschonen laat sik in de <a href=\"help:kplato"
"\">Dokmentatschoon</a> un in't Internet op <a href=\"http://www.koffice.org/"
"kplato\">http://www.koffice.org/kplato</a> finnen.</p>"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:106
msgid "Next: Tips"
msgstr "Nakamen: Tipps"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:145
msgid "Editing tips."
msgstr "Tipps för't Bewerken"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:147
msgid ""
"<br/><b>To</b> edit project data, different views and editors can be "
"selected in the View Selector docker.<br/><b>The</b> views are generally "
"used to inspect data after the project has been scheduled. No data will "
"appear in the views if the project has not been scheduled. Scheduling is "
"done in the Schedules editor.<br/><b>You</b> can edit attributes in the "
"various editors by selecting the item you want to edit (doubleclick or press "
"F2), or open a dialog using the context menu.</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<br/><b>Dat</b> Bewerken vun Projektdaten, anner Ansichten un Editoren lett "
"sik in den Ansichtköör-Docker instellen.<br/><b>Mit</b> de Ansichten laat "
"sik de Daten vun plaant Projekten ankieken. Is dat Projekt nich plaant, "
"warrt ok keen Daten wiest. Plaant warrt mit den Plaaneditor.<br/><b>Mit</b> "
"de verscheden Editoren laat sik de Attributen bewerken, wenn Een en Indrag "
"för't Bewerken utsöcht (Dubbelklick oder F2), oder mit dat Rechtsklickmenü "
"den tohören Dialoog.</ul>"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:153
msgid "Next: Create a simple project"
msgstr "Nakamen: En eenfach Projekt opstellen"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:188
msgid "Create the simplest project ever."
msgstr "Dat eenfachste Projekt överhööft opstellen"

